OL,3,AWhite House defends new press secretary
OL,4,Aover her legal credentials
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe White House is defending its new
OL,7,Fpress secretary, Katie Zacharia, as she
OL,8,Ffaces scrutiny over her legal
OL,9,Fcredentials.
OL,11,FPresident Donald Trump described
OL,12,FZacharia as an attorney when announcing
OL,13,Fher appointment last week. She has
OL,14,Freferred to herself as a lawyer.
OL,16,FBut when she was asked on Tuesday by a
OL,17,Freporter in which state she had passed
OL,18,Fthe bar exam required to be an attorney
OL,19,Fin the US, she said standing alongside
OL,20,Fthe president: "When I moved to China."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
