OL,3,AWhite House defends new press secretary
OL,4,Aover her legal credentials
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe does not appear to be registered to
OL,7,Fthe bar in any state where she has
OL,8,Flived. White House communications
OL,9,Fdirector Steven Cheung said Zacharia is
OL,10,F"uniquely qualified and whip smart to
OL,11,Fhelp inform the American people".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
